Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:04.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Ikite ikite ikitsukuse\N{\rSong-2}Live, live on, with all your might{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:09.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Hikari o mirai e\N{\rSong-2}Follow the light to the future{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.13,0:00:23.29,Song,,0,0,0,,Uragirareta kodoku na sekai ni torinokosare\N{\rSong-2}Betrayed and left behind in this lonely world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:28.83,Song,,0,0,0,,Miushinatta ashita o osorete ima mo\N{\rSong-2}Fearing a tomorrow I've lost sight of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:31.96,Song,,0,0,0,,Ibasho o sagasu\N{\rSong-2}I search for the place I belong{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.96,0:00:38.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Hitsuyou to saretai kokoro no sakebi\N{\rSong-2}My heart screams out, "I want to be needed"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.67,0:00:47.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Karamiau IDENTITY tashikametainda shinjite iikana\N{\rSong-2}I want to puzzle out these entwined identities, but can I trust them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:50.58,Song,,0,0,0,,Ikite ikite ikitsukuse\N{\rSong-2}Live, live on, with all your might{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:54.58,Song,,0,0,0,,Hikari o mirai e\N{\rSong-2}Follow the light to the future{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:58.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Tatoe subete ushinattemo\N{\rSong-2}Even if you lose everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:01:02.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Kibou o tsunaide\N{\rSong-2}Stay connected to hope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.67,0:01:06.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Boku ga koko ni iru imi\N{\rSong-2}I don't know why I'm here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.58,0:01:10.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Ima wa wakaranakute mo ii\N{\rSong-2}But that's all right with me right now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:13.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Kimi to waraiaeru you ni\N{\rSong-2}I have to overcome and press on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.92,0:01:19.83,Song,,0,0,0,,Jibun de tachikitte susumudake\N{\rSong-2}So I can smile with you again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yay! Vacation, vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.29,0:01:39.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Lily, we are not here to enjoy ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.63,0:01:42.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is a learning opportunity for us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.83,0:01:46.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, please. We're not going\Nto learn anything while we're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.92,0:01:51.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've only been officially employed with us\Nfor a month. How could you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because I've been on lots of\N'work learning opportunity' trips,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.50,0:01:57.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and they all end up being fun vacations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.29,0:02:00.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It won't be any different with the Demon Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.29,0:02:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is why I hired you, Leo.\NYour wealth of experience is invaluable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But can you still claim that after seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.25,0:02:14.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's hella run down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:21.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I like it! This place has quite the character!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.42,0:02:24.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mernes, you chose this place, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.71,0:02:30.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's got four walls and\Na roof and it's deserted. It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.54,0:02:33.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,THAT'S how you picked a place to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see nothing wrong with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.58,0:02:40.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If the public learned the leaders of the Demon Army\Nwere gathering here, they would panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:44.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's imperative that we lie low for the duration of our trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That makes sense. No one will find out\Nwho we are at an inn this deserted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.63,0:02:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I told Shutina to book us\Nunder false names to help with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:02.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did tell you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:08.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welcome, great leaders of the Demon Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:10.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, the cat's out of the bag now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sheesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:14.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come now, it's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.29,0:03:15.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Thanks for having us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're so glad to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.63,0:03:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We have a lovely outdoor spring for you\Nto bathe in. I highly recommend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:26.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An outdoor spring! That sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:29.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've no hot springs to bathe in at the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I may need to soak in the spring with a glass of ale.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:38.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's a 'spring'? Is it like a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, but bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.71,0:03:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can I swim in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:44.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why not?! I wanna go swimming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:45.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Let's focus, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:47.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We are here to work, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.25,0:03:50.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I could just have a representative\Nfor your group sign here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:52.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:04.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're very welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.63,0:04:07.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I should inform you that you may encounter\Nunwanted visitors during your stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.17,0:04:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:18.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:19.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:20.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gh-ghosts?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the rumor is merely\Nthe result of a misunderstanding,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.33,0:04:28.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but in the case that it isn't, please keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Will we be okay? Can we fight ghosts?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.29,0:04:34.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.33,0:04:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ghosts don't exist. It's just superstition. All superstition!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:45.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-yes! And if we do encounter one,\NI will destroy it with a spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:46.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Worry not, Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:49.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, good! I feel better now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:53.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If only it were just superstition...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.29,0:05:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Delicious! This is good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The food and amenities are wonderful, too.\NGreat job finding this inn, Mernes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.88,0:05:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:21.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We still haven't done anything work-related, though.\NIsn't this a learning opportunity?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:26.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We spent an hour discussing work!\NThat is more than enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:29.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, c'mon! This is 100% just a vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.75,0:05:35.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cease your prattling! We are Army leaders on\Na journey, not a vacation. My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:38.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Queen Echidna?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:41.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am going for a walk, and to purchase some snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:43.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shall I accompany you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what if you run into a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.71,0:05:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:52.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right. I'd forgotten to give you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:58.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The innkeep gave us these charms\Nof protection. Take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:05:59.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Charms?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.50,0:06:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:15.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She says they are ghost-dispelling charms that\Nhave been passed down here for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ghost-dispelling charms... You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am. We wouldn't want to be attacked by spirits, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do ensure you wear them at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.33,0:06:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:30.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, I have four ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.92,0:06:31.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:36.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These things dispel ghosts? Come on. I'm gonna pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see, you're going to pass, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:43.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I suppose we should have\Nanother private drinking party, you and I!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:46.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seeing as we seemingly need to strengthen our--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:48.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll wear them with pride, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.00,0:06:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get them on! Your Queen commands it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.42,0:06:56.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to wear them, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:07:01.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They will look flattering on the women, but can you say\Nthe same for us men?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:05.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Orders from the boss!\NKeep your head down and obey, Edvard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:08.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is harassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:10.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You all look wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:12.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On that note...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:19.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With these, I will be fine to move about on my own.\NDo not remove the charms, now, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:21.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Okay!\N{\rSubtitle}Yes, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Echidna's been gone a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:39.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:41.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think she blacked out somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Surely you jest. Echidna's tolerance\Nfor liquor is that of a bottomless pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why're there three of you, Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, this one's punch-drunk on catnip juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:59.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Catnip does have that affect on canines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.42,0:08:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:01.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go check on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't ditch 'cause you're losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:05.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not. I just won.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Will you be all right on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.79,0:08:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are no ghosts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.33,0:08:16.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shutina... Are you afraid of ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:22.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-of course not! I'm just being careful in\Nthe one in a million chance there's danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm getting pretty tired of playing Tycoon,\Nso let's take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How about another drink then, Leo?\NYou still have it in you, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:44.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've been doing nothing BUT drinking this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:49.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, of course! This is a special occasion,\Nwhy not share it with good friends and drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.25,0:08:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tonight, we shall drink until we are sated!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.58,0:08:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't drink too much, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.63,0:08:58.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:01.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nothing, just... That.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:03.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:13.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did it move?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.83,0:09:17.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-of course not! You must be seeing things!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:23.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who's there? Echidna? Mernes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:30.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:34.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Queen Echidna and Mernes have both been absent for a\Nwhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I must assure their safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, you can't! Acting without permission\Nwill destroy the chain of command!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.83,0:09:50.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's tough to figure out what to do\Nwhen your boss isn't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hello! Anyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:10:01.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know not your intentions,\Nbut you should not play pranks on--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Edvard! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.79,0:10:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop messing around and open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:10.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right! You're not the type to joke around...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-the light!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.58,0:10:19.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.33,0:10:22.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's a logical expl...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:27.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:35.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ow! What is this?! What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:38.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ugh! Where is it coming from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:42.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shutina, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's that? Is THAT... a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:48.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:52.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a rotary phone.\NAn artifact from the Mechanical Age.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Humans used these before I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:10:58.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's it doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:11:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Allow me to silence it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Enis la fide sol...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.71,0:11:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O wind, bring forth utter quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:08.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:11.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.13,0:11:14.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.79,0:11:16.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.67,0:11:20.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O wind, bring forth utter quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.67,0:11:22.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Utter quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.29,0:11:23.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now YOU need to be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:28.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leo, my spell isn't working! What do we do now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll try. Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.00,0:11:33.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:36.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leo! Do something, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can both of you shut up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You try, Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:54.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, Lily, listen close. Ghosts aren't real.\NThey're just superstition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:59.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, we have plenty of proof.\NThis was the work of a spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:11:59.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.79,0:12:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I was young, we read\Na tome about ghosts and spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.63,0:12:08.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ghosts are the strongest human monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.25,0:12:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't see them and magic doesn't\Nwork on them. They're invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ghosts may exist even in the Demon World!\NWe might be in trouble, Echidna!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:22.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What if one of these things attacks us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.96,0:12:29.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not to worry! If spells don't work,\Nthen we shall punch it to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.29,0:12:33.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But how do we punch something we can't see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:36.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Shutina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:41.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ghosts are formidable enemies,\Nbut I will protect you from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.33,0:12:42.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Echidna...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You see?! We'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:51.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A ghost may be among us,\Nbut Queen Echidna will keep us safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.50,0:12:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Help us, Echidna!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:12:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why'd you make things more complicated,\Nyou bumbling idiot succubus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:12:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.67,0:13:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I said it! You're an adult,\Nit's your job to calm Lily down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.29,0:13:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:08.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.79,0:13:11.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Queen Echidna!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're in danger! My spells aren't working,\Nand strange things keep happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:18.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've encountered strange happenings as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I cannot find anyone in this inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.25,0:13:25.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not the innkeep nor her staff.\NIt's as if they never existed to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-no...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.79,0:13:31.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know it's dififcult to believe, but it's likely a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.67,0:13:34.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where are the other three Generals?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You didn't run into them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.75,0:13:36.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's weird. Mernes and Edvard\Nwent out looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, three?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.21,0:13:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily?! Hey, Lily! Where'd you go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.25,0:13:49.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,D-did the ghost take Lily!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:51.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is growing dire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:54.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shutina! Leo! We must find our colleagues at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:55.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.83,0:01:36.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(345.6,612)}{\an7}Remember, the Work Trip is First and Foremost a Learning Opportunity (Part 1)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:07.58,Caption-2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(908.8,547.2)}{\an7}To Be Continued
